      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking at some ceramic shards from a late bronze age stratum in the Peloponnese. can you help me distinguish between different firing techniques used in the region during that period? specifically looking at how to tell if they were pit-fired vs kiln-fired based on the cross-section and surface.",
